  "label": {
    "en": [
      "The image shows the address side of an old French postcard labeled \"RÉPUBLIQUE FRANÇAISE – CARTE POSTALE\" in red. It has red French postage stamps cancelled with a circular postmark from Paris. The address is handwritten in ink to a Madame Elena A. Mureșianu at \"Villa Schwertz\" in Brașov (noted also as Brassó) in Transylvania, then part of Austria-Hungary."
    ]
